00:00:14.694 --> 00:00:17.584
and she is the professional
learning design coordinator.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.514
So I'm excited to talk to her

00:00:19.514 --> 00:00:21.804
about professional learning for teachers.

00:00:21.804 --> 00:00:25.834
Before we get started, I
want to remind everyone

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.864
